 RL directly from the base model achieves surprisingly strong performance, aligning with re- cent findings in Deepseek-R1-Zero [   13   ] Meanwhile, initializing RL with CoT-SFT provides clear and con- sistent improvements across all difficulty levels, with an average accuracy of 59.8% compared to 50.1% of  G1 -Zero-3B Besides, we notice that relative improve- 8'::text, 'doc'::varchar(50), NULL, '{}'::jsonb, ''-3':124 '-7':65 '0':16 '1':46,139 '1.3':25 '13':161 '20':17 '22.7':26 '26.0':29 '3.4':30 '30.2':23 '3b':41,44,52,57,107,118,192 '3b-instruct':117 '40':18 '41.2':34 '45.7':22 '50.1':31,187 '59.8':36,184 '60':19 '7.6':35 '73.5':28 '8':199 '80':20 '84.6':33 '88.6':27 '9.4':24 '94.9':32 'accuraci':21,48,182 'achiev':147 'across':175 'align':151 'appendix':7,68 'averag':13,181 'b':66,125 'base':114,145 'behavior':93 'benchmark':60 'besid':193 'c.1':69 'cent':154 'challeng':12 'checkpoint':134 'clear':170 'cold':80 'compar':101,185 'comparison':49 'con':172 'cot':132,167 'cot-sft':131,166 'd':8 'deepseek':158 'deepseek-r1-zero':157 'difficulti':14,177 'direct':110,142 'easi':9 'effect':97 'evalu':85 'explor':1 'figur':45,138 'find':155 'g1':39,43,51,55,104,123,189 'g1-3b':42 'g1-zero-3b':38,54 'hard':11 'impact':87 'improv':174,198 'includ':62 'initi':127,163 'instruct':119 'isol':95 'level':15,178 'meanwhil':162 'mechan':82 'medium':10 'model':115,146 'notic':195 'perform':90,150 'provid':169 'qwen2.5-':116 'qwen2.5-3b-instruct':37 'r1':159 're':153 'relat':197 'respons':92 'result':63 'reward':3 'reward-weight':2 'rl':84,121,128,141,164 'role':75 'sft':70,77,99,133,168 'shown':136 'sistent':173 'start':81 'strategi':5 'strong':149 'studi':73 'surpris':148 'test':47 'train':111,140 'two':102 'variant':103 'warmup':71 'weight':4 'zero':40,56,106,160,191 'zero-3b':105,190'::tsvector, NOW()),
